{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "XlVSzh", "date": "1482867208", "viewed": 411, "name": "Cyber Space", "username": "Xor", "description": "I'm not good at descriptions.\nEdit: Reduced from around 500 chars to 237 thanks to iq and FabriceNeyret2.", "likes": 10, "published": 1, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": ["3d", "voxels", "light", "glow"], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "", "parentname": ""}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [{"id": "4dfGRr", "channel": 0}], "code": "/*\n\t\"Cyber Space\" by Xor\n\n\tIt was shortened thanks to iq and FabriceNeyret2.\n*/\nvoid mainImage(out vec4 O,vec2 I)\n{\n    vec3 R = iResolution;\n    \n    R = vec3(2, (I+I-R.xy)/R.y);\n\n    O -= O;\n\n    for (float i = -8.; i<8.; i+=.1)\n        O += vec4(.3,.6,1,0) *\n        \t (1.-i*i/64.) *\n             smoothstep(.99,1.,\n             fract(3e2*cos(dot(floor(iTime*vec3(4,1,0)+(i+14.)*R), vec3(7,8,86)))));\n}", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}